# Frontend deploy env vars — copy to /mnt/ssd/@docker/leetcodeview/.env.frontend
# on the VPS (see deploy-fe.sh, which sources this path before
# `docker stack deploy -c .ci/stack-fe.yml`).
#
# Honest current state: no variables are required today. The Angular
# build's own environment.ts (empty apiBaseUrl/wsBaseUrl — same-origin,
# proxied by nginx to the `api` service) is baked in at BUILD time, not
# read from this file or from any container env var at runtime — so there
# is nothing to configure here yet. This file still needs to EXIST on the
# VPS (even empty), same reasoning as .env.example at the repo root.
